cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this project, please cite it as below.
title: "Viet Nam Knowledge Commons (VNKC)"
abstract: >-
  Verified, versioned, and machine-ready knowledge about Viet Nam:
  an open, provenance-first foundation of legal, administrative, and
  public-life knowledge, with strictly separated source, canonical,
  and ML dataset layers.
authors:
  - name: "The Resonance Team"
type: dataset
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/The-Resonance-Team/vietnam-knowledge-commons"
repository-code: "https://github.com/The-Resonance-Team/vietnam-knowledge-commons"
keywords:
  - vietnam
  - open-data
  - legal-informatics
  - knowledge-commons
  - datasets
notes: >-
  Code is Apache-2.0; collected data carries a per-source license manifest
  (see DATA_LICENSES.md). Cite the specific dataset release and version you use.
